Note on PyMuPDF: it is an **optional** extra used only for render spot-check
(docx -> PDF -> PNG). Deployments that cannot accept AGPL-3.0 must either
obtain a commercial license from Artifex or leave `extras: office` uninstalled
and provide a compatible external rendering workflow instead.

The preview extra uses PDFium for PDF text and bitmap processing. Retain the
upstream pypdfium2/PDFium license and dependency notices when redistributing
their wheels or binaries. It does not provide a DOCX layout engine.
